 { This is taken from a game between Pogos Nakhapetiane (White) and Sergei Zhigalko (Black) . What did Zhigalko miss here? } 1... { -KEY- } Qa4 { With an unstoppable threat of ...Nb3+. To find this move, you need to recognise that White has zero threats other than Qxc2. At the same time, we are one defender away from making Nb3+ work. By controlling the critical b3 square, we get a healthy edge. } 
