 { This is a position taken from a game between Ivan Sokolov (White) and Nikola Mitkov (Black) . Can you find a better move than what Mitkov played in the game? } 1... { -KEY- } Re5 { The Queen is a trappable piece. By placing the Rook on e5, we seal up the Queen's escape route. } 2. dxe5 Ne8 { And we are left with a decent material advantage } 
