 { Can you find the best move for Gregory Serper in his game with Hikaru Nakamura? } 81. { -KEY- } Nxg3 hxg3 82. Nxe4 $3 { The resulting endgame is drawn. } Kxe4 83. Kf1 { Don't be disheartened if you got this one wrong despite having seen this pattern in Chapter 3. It just goes to show that the same pattern can be seen in many forms, and you can never understand a pattern too well. } 
